    "excerpt": "<p>Dear student,</p>\n<p>No guarantee but these are the major topics discussed in the course, in the order of ease (this is my opinion, might be different for you):</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Sed</li>\n<li>Awk</li>\n<li>grep (regex maybe complicated but the question is very simple)</li>\n<li>Bash script</li>\n<li>File system (replicating the given directory structure)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>All the best.</p>\n<p>Thank you<br>\nPrakhar Arora<br>\nTeaching Assistant for System Commands</p>",
